<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Course Requirements Schedule</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  body {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 24pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Course Requirements Schedule *</h1>

  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 30px;">
    <thead>
      <tr style="background-color: #f0f0f0;">
        <th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center; width: 15%;">Semester</th>
        <th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center; width: 25%;">Middle Level MAT (30 credit hours)</th>
        <th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center; width: 25%;">Secondary MAT (30 credit hours)</th>
        <th style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center; width: 25%;">Modern Languages MAT (30 credit hours)</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center;">SUMMER I YEAR 1 (6 credit hours)</td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDLT 8270 – Disciplinary Literacy</p>
          <p>ED 8030/8031 – Methods of Teaching at Middle and Secondary Levels</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDLT 8270 – Disciplinary Literacy</p>
          <p>ED 8030/8031 – Methods of Teaching at Middle and Secondary Levels</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDLT 8270 – Disciplinary Literacy</p>
          <p>ED 8030/8031 – Methods of Teaching at Middle and Secondary Levels</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center;">SUMMER II YEAR 1 (6 credit hours)</td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDF 8020 – Learning and Motivation in Context</p>
          <p>EDML 8410 – Advanced Middle School Curriculum and Instruction</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDF 8020 – Learning and Motivation in Context</p>
          <p>EDML 8410 – Advanced Middle School Curriculum and Instruction</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDF 8020 – Learning and Motivation in Context</p>
          <p>EDML 8410 – Advanced Modern School Curriculum and Instruction OR ED 8650 Curriculum Theory</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center;">FALL YEAR 1 (6 credit hours)</td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDLT 8100 – Foundations in Literacy</p>
          <p>Discipline-Specific Method Courses – Students select one of the following options:</p>
          <ul style="margin-top: 5px; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>EDML 8110 – Language Arts</li>
            <li>EDML 8120 – Social Studies</li>
            <li>EDML 8130 – Mathematics</li>
            <li>EDML 8140 – Science</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDLT 8100 – Foundations in Literacy</p>
          <p>Discipline-Specific Method Courses – Students select one of the following options:</p>
          <ul style="margin-top: 5px; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>EDSC 8160 – Science</li>
            <li>EDSC 8620 – Mathematics</li>
            <li>EDSC 8630 – English</li>
            <li>EDSC 8640 – Social Studies</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDLT 8100 – Foundations in Literacy</p>
          <p>Discipline-Specific Method Courses – Students select one of the following options:</p>
          <ul style="margin-top: 5px; padding-left: 20px;">
            <li>EDSC 8910 – Directed Internship</li>
            <li>EDSC 8920 – Capstone Seminar</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center;">SPRING YEAR 1 (6 credit hours)</td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>Discipline Internship Certificate with Partner District (in spring, employment as licensed teacher in partner district)</p>
          <p>Traditional Student Teaching (in spring, employment as licensed teacher)</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>Internship Certificate with Partner District (in spring, employment as licensed teacher in partner district)</p>
          <p>Traditional Student Teaching (in spring, employment as licensed teacher)</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>Internship Certificate with Partner District (in spring, employment as licensed teacher in partner district)</p>
          <p>Traditional Student Teaching (in spring, employment as licensed teacher)</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px; text-align: center;">SUMMER I YEAR 2 (6 credit hours)</td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDSP 8230 – Teaching Individuals with Disabilities in Integrated Settings</p>
          <p>EDF 8350 – Early-Late Adolescent Growth and Development</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDSP 8230 – Teaching Individuals with Disabilities in Integrated Settings</p>
          <p>EDF 8350 – Early-Late Adolescent Growth and Development</p>
        </td>
        <td style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 10px;">
          <p>EDSP 8230 – Teaching Individuals with Disabilities in Integrated Settings</p>
          <p>EDF 8350 – Early-Late Adolescent Growth and Development</p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 30px;">* Field experiences are incorporated into Summer I (year 1), Fall and Spring sessions.</p>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 45%; border: 2px solid #cc0000; padding: 20px; background-color: #fff0f0;">
      <h2 style="color: #cc0000; margin-top: 0;">APPLY TODAY!</h2>
      <p>Application deadline is <span data-field="application_deadline">{{ application_deadline }}</span>.</p>
      <p>Apply online at <span data-field="application_url">{{ application_url }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%; border: 2px solid #cc0000; padding: 20px; background-color: #fff0f0;">
      <h2 style="color: #cc0000; margin-top: 0;">MORE INFORMATION</h2>
      <p>Contact Dr. <span data-field="contact_name">{{ contact_name }}</span>, program coordinator, at <span data-field="contact_email">{{ contact_email }}</span>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>